{ "format": "xitdb-script/1", "description": "Finding 26, as the port does it, on a version 1 file (inputs/v1-sliced-holes): an iterator goes through the positions from where it starts up to the size of the list, skipping one that is truly empty, so it agrees with a read by index.", "hash_size": 20, "hash_id": "sha1", "file_id": "0011223344556677",
  "ops": [
